	(text_box "HOW TO READ THIS\nEach box above is one page. Power arrives on page 1 (the dock), is stored and cleaned on page 2, and feeds the brain on page 3. Sound comes in on page 4 (the microphone) and goes out on page 5 (the speaker driver).\nFlag-shaped labels with the same name are the same wire, even on different pages. Arrow and bar symbols (+3V0, VSYS, VBAT, GND) are power rails. Yellow boxes explain each block in plain words."
